# Operator-specific governance files — contain program aliases, DPA reviewer names,
# approver identities, and M365 series_ids that identify the operator's org.
# These are required for local operation but must never be published.
# Generic templates/documentation (README, model-cards, etc.) remain tracked.
governance/dpa-scope.md
governance/roles/*.yaml
